@startuml
!pragma layout smetana

title SensoBazaar — System Context

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam actorBorderColor #374151
skinparam actorFontColor #111827

actor "User" as User
actor "Administrator" as Admin

rectangle "Web SPA\nReact" as SPA #E8F1FF
rectangle "SensoBazaar Backend" as Backend #EEF7EE
rectangle "Edge Gateway / Emulator\nC++ / MQTT client" as Gateway #FFF4E5
rectangle "Blockchain network\n(after MVP)" as Chain #F5F5F5
rectangle "Crypto wallet\n(after MVP)" as Wallet #F5F5F5

User --> SPA : HTTPS
Admin --> SPA : HTTPS
SPA --> Backend : REST / SSE\nJWT
Gateway --> Backend : MQTT over TLS\nQoS 1
Backend ..> Chain : LedgerPort / PaymentPort\nplanned
User ..> Wallet : planned

note bottom of Backend
Current backend architecture:
modular monolith core + separate ingest service.
end note

@enduml
